 "note": "Chapter opener. Pale-green banner (#d3ead3, y 0.038-0.382) topped by a thin dark-green strip (#4c7436) with a brown block (#735921) at the right end, both reported as decorative_image. Banner holds the QR code (with '12083CH11' code under it), a decorative tilted pBR322 plasmid artwork on a dark-green square (decorative_image, not a figure - no A2 block), 'CHAPTER 9' (n=1, size_rel 2.6) and the two-line title 'BIOTECHNOLOGY : PRINCIPLES AND PROCESSES' (n=2, size_rel 3.05), both dark sans-light. Orange rule_bar (#f7931d) y 0.392-0.433. Two columns below: left = contents panel (#fee5ca, rounded lower corners, italic serif 9.1/9.2/9.3 entries; no A2 block so n null) with a grey shadow bar (#dbdcde) under it (decorative_image); right = prose. Prose blocks: n=3 (13 lines, 'Biotechnology' bold, 'in vitro' italic), n=4 and n=5 with first-line indent, green small-caps section heading 9.1 (n=6, colour sampled from glyph interiors ~#00ae4c), n=7, and list item (i) n=8 (indented ~0.044 page width; continues on the next page). body_text_size_px = cap height of 'B' in 'Biotechnology' (20px). No printed folio on this page; the 'Reprint 2026-27' stamp at the foot (y~0.974) is not a folio and is left out. Diagonal 'not to be republished' watermark ignored. size_pt not given (DPI not stated)."
